# 源数据（20 GB 栅格 / netCDF）不入库，只放开仓库根 data/ 下求解与出图要读的三样：ChinaMapTHT/（地图底图）、
# ChinaMap/（候选管网图；重建输入也读）、ChinaBasins/basin_l1.gpkg（开水约束的求解与出图）。
# `data/` 一行照旧忽略任何一层名为 data 的目录（如 results/figures/<版本>/data/ 的结果拷贝），`!/data/` 一行只放开仓库根那一个。
data/
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/ChinaMapTHT/
!/data/ChinaMap/
!/data/ChinaBasins/
/data/ChinaBasins/*
!/data/ChinaBasins/basin_l1.gpkg

# 归档区（2.4 GB，2026-09-06 从主线移出，见 _archive_20260906/README.md）
_archive_20260906/

# 可再生的缓存与构建产物
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# 机器本地 / 按 .claude/rules/security.md 不入库
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Loose solve outputs. Real results are deposited into results/figures/<version>/data/
# by scripts/render_version.py; anything else here is a scratch or validation run and must
# never be mistaken for a published one (CLAUDE.md 二.6).
/results/*
!/results/figures/

# v9.1 solve tree: removed from the current version on 2026-09-28 (still in a303f05). Its results/ and
# the data junction to the main data/ were never tracked; keep ignoring them in existing checkouts.
_v91tree/results/
_v91tree/data

# Industry + coal solve tree (ST_ family): code lives in the root src/, the tree holds inputs and
# results only. Its inputs -- including the 2026-09-12 rebuilt network -- belong in git; results
# are archived under results/figures/<version>/, and data is a junction to the main data/.
_indtree/results/
_indtree/data
